{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S09把“想在难受的时候有人陪”推成了“怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，比Y更替人物下结论，削弱了心理动机的开放性。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点词突出，叙事与感受交替呈现，感受又能跟随音乐实际出现的时机展开，普通观众更容易在听音乐时抓住每段转折，并感受到情绪从压抑、怀念、挣扎到逐渐安定的细微变化。Y的叙事在个别心理动机上更克制准确，尤其S09对“怀念过去”和“需要陪伴”的区分；但整体感受更像并列的词语清单，音乐情绪的先后、起伏和层次不如X容易感知。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "56898aa1-f9b2-4a7c-8677-78574f296508", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T231111703692Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.844, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:12:18.551840+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d46704c271073b459815d3c682f1d14d18284401bcde38bf46096cd8f74fc57b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.p